{
  "info": {
    "name": "Apinata Demo",
    "description": "# Apinata Demo\n\nA small tour of Apinata.\n\n- **Posts** and **Users** call [JSONPlaceholder](https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com), a free fake REST API.\n- **Media** calls [httpbin](https://httpbin.org) for responses that are not JSON.\n- **Auth** shows digest, NTLM, AWS Sig v4 signing and an OAuth 1.0 signature httpbin echoes.\n\nSending a request needs network access.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Posts",
